<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five stocks fell, two rose and four were flat in 4.5-million-zloty Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday with the WIG 20 index down 0.9 percent to 1,490.4 points.</p>
<p>The remaining 12 stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units were flat at 140 zlotys in a 6.1-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
